                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2、连续系统的模拟框图表示微分方程"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                109,
                487,
                124
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "(1)方程右端不含有激励导数项"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                133,
                433,
                149
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "①画图原则：图形最左侧【整体输入】为激励，最右侧【整体输出】为响应，即中间区域为画图区域，类似于黑盒子"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                183,
                157,
                810,
                199
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/ac2e4f61cc833b6f3b20703b24e9ddad9121171f73d66defe9ef0257383670f8.jpg"
                },
                "content": "",
                "image_caption": [],
                "image_footnote": []
            },
            "bbox": [
                319,
                220,
                658,
                257
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "②画图流程:"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                266,
                289,
                282
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "微分方程标准形式(已知)→响应最高导数项=多项式之和的形式→围绕加法器设定输入和输出【时刻谨遵原则：左输入，右输出】"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                290,
                810,
                331
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "例21：已知系统的微分方程为  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\frac{d}{dt} r(t) + a_0r(t) = b_0e(t)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "，试画出其模拟框图。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                339,
                786,
                363
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "例 22: 已知系统微分方程为  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\frac{d^{2}}{dt^{2}} r(t) + a_{1} \\frac{d}{dt} r(t) + a_{0} r(t) = b_{0} e(t)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": ", 试画出其模拟框图。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                526,
                810,
                574
            ]
